re AWESOME!'=>'Elektron pochtangiz muvaffaqiyatli tasdiqlandi - siz ajoyibsiz!','License key is empty.'=>'Litsenziya kaliti boʻsh.','Enabling white-label mode'=>'White-label rejimi yoqilmoqda','End'=>'Tugash','Enter email address'=>'E-pochta manzilini kiriting','Enter the new email address'=>'Yangi e-pochta manzilini kiriting','Error'=>'Xato','as expiration dateExpiration'=>'Muddati','Expired'=>'Muddati oʻtgan','Expires in %s'=>'%s ichida muddati tugaydi','Extensions'=>'Kengaytmalar','Extra domains where you will be marketing the product from.'=>'Mahsulotni targʻib qiladigan qoʻshimcha domenlar.','Extra Domains'=>'Qoʻshimcha domenlar','Freemius SDK couldn\'t find the plugin\'s main file. Please contact sdk@freemius.com with the current error.'=>'Freemius SDK plaginning asosiy faylini topa olmadi. Iltimos, mavjud xatolik bilan sdk@freemius.com manziliga murojaat qiling.','Plugin installer section titleFAQ'=>'FAQ','Plugin installer section titleFeatures & Pricing'=>'Xususiyatlar va narxlar','We made a few tweaks to the %1$s, %2$s'=>'%1$s ga bir nechta oʻzgartirishlar kiritdik, %2$s','File'=>'Fayl','Filter'=>'Filtrlash','Please follow these steps to complete the upgrade'=>'Yangilanishni yakunlash uchun quyidagi bosqichlarni bajaring','Free'=>'Bepul','Add-on must be deployed to WordPress.org or Freemius.'=>'Qoʻshimcha WordPress.org yoki Freemius tizimiga joylashtirilishi kerak.','Free Trial'=>'Bepul sinov','Free version'=>'Bepul versiya','Freemius API'=>'Freemius API','Freemius Debug'=>'Freemius nosozliklarni tuzatish','Freemius State'=>'Freemius holati','Full name'=>'Toʻliq ism','Function'=>'Funksiya','Get updates for bleeding edge Beta versions of %s.'=>'%s uchun eng soʻnggi Beta versiyalari yangilanishlarini oling.','Have a license key?'=>'Litsenziya kalitingiz bormi?','advance notice of something that will need attention.Heads up'=>'Diqqat','exclamationHey'=>'Salom','greetingHey %s,'=>'Salom, %s,','verbHide'=>'Yashirish','something somebody says when they are