 has been successfully started.'=>'Sinov muddatingiz muvaffaqiyatli boshlandi.','You already utilized a trial before.'=>'Siz avval sinov muddatidan foydalangansiz.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Hozirgacha %1$s sizga qanday yoqmoqda? Barcha %2$s premium imkoniyatlarimizni %3$d kunlik bepul sinov muddati bilan sinab koʻring.','Type'=>'Turi','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Fayl tizimiga ulanib bo‘lmadi. Iltimos, hisob ma’lumotlaringizni tasdiqlang.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'So‘rovingizni qayta ishlashda kutilmagan API xatosi yuz berdi. Iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so‘ng qayta urinib ko‘ring va agar u hali ham ishlamasa, quyidagilar bilan %s muallifiga murojaat qiling:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Kutilmagan xatolik yuz berdi, 5 daqiqadan so‘ng qayta urinib ko‘ring. Agar xatolik davom etsa, qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'%s dasturini oʻchirib tashlash litsenziyani avtomatik ravishda faolsizlantiradi va siz undan boshqa saytda foydalanishingiz mumkin boʻladi.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Nomaʼlum xato yuz berdi.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Cheksiz komissiyalar.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Cheksiz yangilanishlar','verbUpdate'=>'Yangilash','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Yangilanishni davom ettirishni xohlaysizmi?','Update'=>'Yangilash','Update License'=>'Litsenziyani yangilang','Upgrade'=>'Yangilang','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Muhim yangilanish bildirishnomasi:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Yuklab olingan versiyani yuklang va faollashtiring','User Dashboard'=>'Foydalanuvchi paneli','Sorry